{"author":{"id":"2462ded6f56967dde059994c39a506c79e39e5dfd10c5a07f07a23a5652a8353"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1775841397,"nonce":"eP9dfd7n1OmGLLXHKqmHUnjSkQ8=","title":"Add CLI command to trace goal completion status across files","message":"## Problem\nWhen debugging staleness detection issues, there's no easy way to see where a goal is marked complete vs incomplete across progress files.\n\n## Proposed Solution\nAdd `jessica goal-status \u003ctext\u003e` command that:\n1. Searches all progress files for the goal text (fuzzy match via normalize_goal_text)\n2. Reports each occurrence with: file path, date, horizon, done status\n3. Sorted by date (newest first)\n\nExample output:\n```\nGoal: \"correlated prediction markets to bitcoin price\"\n\n2026-04-13 (week)  [x] ~/src/plans/2026/04-13.md:142\n2026-04-07 (day)   [x] ~/src/plans/2026/04-07.md:191  \n2026-04-06 (week)  [ ] ~/src/plans/2026/04-06.md:138\n2026-04-06 (week)  [ ] ~/src/plans/2026/04-06.md:642\n```\n\n## Files\n- src/jessica/cli.py (add goal-status command)\n- src/jessica/scanner.py (may reuse scan_progress_files)\n\n## Tests\n- tests/test_cli.py::test_goal_status_finds_completed\n- tests/test_cli.py::test_goal_status_shows_all_occurrences\n\nREQ: REQ-001 (debugging tools)","files":null}]}